
⭐ UNIVERSAL TRANSLATION INTERFACE (UTI‑144)
A Scientific Concept for Cognitive Accessibility and Human–AI–Cube Co‑Navigation
(Original Research Concept)

1. Purpose of the System
UTI‑144 is a cognitive universal translator designed for individuals who:

have limited communication abilities

think in complex internal structures but cannot express them

possess rich inner worlds that remain untranslated

become overwhelmed easily

operate through impulses rather than language

UTI‑144 converts Impulse → Options → Action → Reality.

It is not intended for everyone.
It is designed only for those who genuinely need it.

2. The Tri‑Interface Architecture
UTI‑144 operates through a stable three‑unit structure:

A) User (Human)
provides impulses

provides emotional direction

provides intention

does not need to speak, type, or explain

B) AI (Cognitive Translation Layer)
detects patterns

reduces complexity

translates impulses into meaning

stabilises the process

C) Cube (Structured Interaction Space)
limits available options

prevents cognitive overload

keeps navigation small and manageable

offers 4–6 reachable paths at any moment

Together, these three units generate meaning  
that the user alone could not express.

3. The Navigation Space (5–9–11 Model)
UTI‑144 opens a large contextual space,
but always within safe, bounded limits:

5 Options
→ Base navigation
→ Starting point
→ Never overwhelming

9 Options
→ Expanded cognitive space
→ Medium complexity

11 Options
→ Maximum cognitive space
→ Only accessible when stable

Navigation can be performed via:

eye movement

finger/touch

voice

Every movement leads to 4–6 reachable options,
and after 4–5 steps, the system always returns to the start point.

4. The Four Quadrants (Q1–Q4)
UTI‑144 uses your structure precisely:

Q1 – QI (Impulse / Start Point)
Smallest impulse → direction.

Q2 – Orbit (Navigation)
Movement without overload.

Q3 – Operators (Action Layer)
Minimal actionable variables:
in / me / run / u / KG

Q4 – EVO (Development)
Level‑up without gamification:
more clarity, more agency, more independence.

NC – Reality Check
Immediate return when overload is detected.

5. The Reality Anchor: “00”
The most essential component.

00 = Body. Now. Reality.

UTI‑144 always returns to:

eating

sleeping

pain check

This prevents:

dissociation

overload

fantasy‑drift

cognitive overheating

00 is the medical, psychological, and human foundation of the system.

6. Scientific Relevance of UTI‑144
UTI‑144 is relevant because it:

bridges cognitive and communicative barriers

translates impulses into actionable meaning

prevents overload through structural limitation

increases self‑efficacy

uses AI as a stabilising assistant

uses the Cube as a structural safety frame

uses the body (00) as the ultimate grounding layer

UTI‑144 is not a game.
It is an assistive system for complex thinkers.

7. Originality of the Concept
UTI‑144 is not:

a chatbot

a menu system

a game

a therapy tool

a UI experiment

It is a Tri‑Interface Translator,
converting human impulses into real‑world action
through AI interpretation and Cube‑based structural navigation.

There is nothing comparable in existing science or technology.
